UC10 ..> UC01 : <<include>>

UC06 ..> UC11 : <<include>>
UC11 ..> UC12 : <<include>>
UC12 --> RabbitMQ

DataService --> UC13
DataService --> UC14
DataService --> UC15
DataService --> UC16
DataService --> UC17
UC13 --> MongoDB
UC14 --> MongoDB
UC15 ..> UC06 : <<include>>
UC16 --> VnStock
UC17 --> VnStock

note right of UC01
  VnStock API Call:
  - Market: HOSE, HNX, UPCOM
  - History: 10 years
  - Columns: OHLCV + date
end note

note right of UC05
  Composite ID:
  {symbol}_{dateStr}
  Example: VCB_20231123
  Prevents duplicates
end note

note right of UC08
  Update Interval: 15 mins
  Auto restart on crash
  Logging each iteration
end note

note right of UC12
  Exchange: stock.market.data
  Routing: stock.update.{symbol}
  Format: JSON OHLC
end note

