note right of UC241
  **Incremental Sync:**
  - Query stocks từ DB (động)
  - KHÔNG dùng hardcoded list
  - Market: HOSE, HNX, UPCOM, US
end note

note right of UC243
  **VnStock API Call:**
  stock = Vnstock().stock(symbol, market)
  df = stock.quote.history(
    start=start_date,
    end=end_date
  )
  
  **Columns:** time, open, high, 
  low, close, volume
end note

note right of UC251
  **Composite ID:**
  _id = f"{symbol}_{dateStr}"
  Ví dụ: "VCB_20231123"
  
  **Upsert Strategy:**
  - Tránh duplicate
  - Update nếu đã tồn tại
end note

note right of UC261
  **Background Task:**
  - Chạy vòng lặp vô hạn
  - UPDATE_INTERVAL = 900s (15 phút)
  - Tự động restart nếu crash
  - Logging mỗi iteration
end note

note right of UC273
  **RabbitMQ Publishing:**
  - Exchange: stock.market.data (TOPIC)
  - Routing: stock.update.{symbol}
  - Message: JSON OHLC data
  - DeliveryMode: PERSISTENT
end note

note bottom of UC28
  **GET /api/stocks:**
  Response: [
    {
      _id, symbol, name,
      market, exchange
    }
  ]
end note

note bottom of UC34
  **Financial Reports:**
  - Balance Sheet (Bảng cân đối KT)
  - Income Statement (KQKD)
  - Cash Flow (Lưu chuyển tiền tệ)
  - Financial Ratios (Chỉ số TC)
  Period: year/quarter
end note

@enduml
